TC01 – Add a New User
Successfully added a new user through registration. The account was given the default User role and a Pending status.
TC02 – Duplicate Email Registration
Successfully detected an email that was already registered. A message appeared informing the user that the email was already in use.
TC03 – Change User Role
Successfully changed a user's role from User to Admin after confirming the action.
TC04 – Edit User Information
Successfully updated the user's information or settings, and the changes were saved.
TC05 – Block User Account
Successfully blocked an active user account. A confirmation message appeared before the account status changed to Blocked.
TC06 – Reactivate User Account
Successfully reactivated a blocked account. Its status changed back to Active.
TC07 – Approve User Account
Successfully approved a pending user account. Its status changed to Active.
TC08 – Reject User Account
Successfully rejected a pending user account. Its status changed to Disapproved.
TC09 – Admin Access to Superadmin Accounts
Successfully restricted Admin access to Superadmin accounts. These accounts did not appear in the Admin's user list.
TC10 – Admin Attempts to Edit Superadmin Account
Successfully prevented an Admin from accessing or changing a Superadmin account.
TC11 – Last Superadmin Protection
Successfully prevented the removal or downgrading of the last remaining Superadmin account, keeping at least one Superadmin in the system.
